            {
                "entry_id": "782f01b3-da4f-3038-b3e1-584cd8cc8d87",
                "word": "Tophet",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc876df2-6e19-3929-bdf0-58bf3e7b2741",
                        "entry_id": "782f01b3-da4f-3038-b3e1-584cd8cc8d87",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A location near Jerusalem in the valley of Gehenna where children were burned alive as sacrifice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "19f3c964-9113-443f-a48e-be7d113d2acc",
                                "sense_id": "cc876df2-6e19-3929-bdf0-58bf3e7b2741",
                                "text": "And they have built the high places of Tophet, which is in the valley of the son of Hinnom, to burn their sons and their daughters in the fire; which I commanded them not, neither came it into my heart."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                        "entry_id": "782f01b3-da4f-3038-b3e1-584cd8cc8d87",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hell, Gehenna."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "924c4047-3ba3-4aac-a348-a76634ad11c3",
                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                "text": "In this Tophet, they commonly immolated their little children, and sometimes men of more yeers than discretion […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee2bafed-c257-4fa2-9145-16f7d1ac7451",
                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                "text": "But already is the day of their avengement begun; the hero is at length arisen who shall send all such as bear enmity to the true Church, or trust in works of their own, to Tophet!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ffc84df-301d-4ac0-b676-c0645f335afa",
                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                "text": "“Well,” I says, “I cal'late a body could get used to Tophet if he stayed there long enough.” ¶ She flared up; the least mite of a slam at Doctor Wool was enough to set her going."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
