                                "sense_id": "f6a5f82a-e9c1-39d8-80aa-705949e7757a",
                                "text": "They are an important factor indicating a corpus of beliefs common to the important central colonies (Carthage, Sousse, Motya, Sulcis, Nora, Tharros), where tophets and accompanying grave stelae have been found."
